{"title":"Workshop slides & videos","markdown":{"headingText":"Workshop slides & videos","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n## Intro and foundations\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n<iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/mYiFY_vxtgs\" \nframeborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen class=\"video\"></iframe>\n</div>\n\n[Slides](https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1nd1kl1vXD7QPIRDXQG7QSu515ThCnuLvh-oH42HPs7M/edit?usp=sharing)\n\n## Classes and data structures\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n<iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Htlv9Nh9da0\" \nframeborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen class=\"video\"></iframe>\n</div>\n\n[Slides](https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1J80PSOcy3Uusn_U0NzvSTSFZqZXBf_0tz9bCSGumSSI/edit?usp=sharing)\n\n## Files and subsetting\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n<iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/eT_DU4U8KKw\" \nframeborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen class=\"video\"></iframe>\n</div>\n\n[Slides](https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1ePF3t1cO4Ui_5l8giooZWQuPEL-L4h7047bGCV_oQgg/edit?usp=sharing)\n\n## Handy tips and tricks\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n<iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BRx0AD8SqJc\" \nframeborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen class=\"video\"></iframe>\n</div>\n\n[Slides](https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1zO2o39UaeV9o0BbOP-kKZFgku4WfEKia_z2U4-8yJmw/edit?usp=sharing)\n\n## Plots part 1\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n<iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4UrVC1saNKE\" \nframeborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen class=\"video\"></iframe>\n</div>\n\n[Slides](https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1LVAZGos0san43kJbY-VM9jwyUtWthhMhsysNZUgeVpA/edit?usp=sharing)\n\n## Plots part 2\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n<iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Yhh_sQYOx7E\" \nframeborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen class=\"video\"></iframe>\n</div>\n\n[Slides](https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1fDHpFeiP7pckCdOV_WO7yMEfGkL0Yzcu1FDdw6afxWM/edit?usp=sharing)\n\n## Basic stats\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n<iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/